#: src/AppImageIntegration.cpp
msgid ""
"aMule can install desktop launchers, icons, and shell command shortcuts into your home directory so it appears in your application menu like a regularly installed app.\n"
"\n"
"This is reversible - the files live under ~/.local/share/applications, ~/.local/share/icons, and ~/.local/bin, and can be removed at any time.\n"
"\n"
"Install desktop integration now?"
msgstr ""
"aMule kan installere skrivebordsgenveje, ikoner og shell-kommandogenveje i din hjemmemappe, så programmet vises i din programmenu som et normalt installeret program.\n"
"\n"
"Dette kan fortrydes - filerne ligger under ~/.local/share/applications, ~/.local/share/icons og ~/.local/bin og kan fjernes når som helst.\n"
"\n"
"Installer skrivebordsintegration nu?"

#: src/AppImageIntegration.cpp
msgid "Add aMule to your application menu?"
msgstr "Tilføj aMule til din programmenu?"

#: src/AppImageIntegration.cpp
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installer"

#: src/AppImageIntegration.cpp
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "Ikke nu"

#: src/AppImageIntegration.cpp src/amuleDlg.cpp
msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Spørg ikke igen"

#: src/AppImageIntegration.cpp
msgid "Cannot install desktop integration: the APPDIR environment variable is not set. This usually means the AppImage was launched in a non-standard way."
msgstr "Kan ikke installere skrivebordsintegration: miljøvariablen APPDIR er ikke angivet. Dette betyder som regel, at AppImage blev startet på en ikke-standard måde."

#: src/AppImageIntegration.cpp
