#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Show full statistics tree."
msgstr "Vis fuldt statistiktræ."

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"Optionally, a number in the range 0-255 can be passed as an argument to this\n"
"command, which tells how many entries of the client version subtrees should be\n"
"shown. Passing 0 or omitting it means 'unlimited'.\n"
"\n"
"Example: 'statistics 5' will show only the top 5 versions for each client type.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der kan valgfrit angives et tal i intervallet 0-255 som argument til denne\n"
"kommando, som angiver hvor mange poster af klientversions-undertræerne der skal\n"
"vises. Angivelse af 0 eller udeladelse betyder 'ubegrænset'.\n"
"\n"
"Eksempel: 'statistics 5' viser kun de 5 mest udbredte versioner for hver klienttype.\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Shut down aMule."
msgstr "Luk aMule ned."

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"Shut down the remote running core (amule/amuled).\n"
"This will also shut down the text client, since it is unusable without a\n"
"running core.\n"
msgstr ""
"Luk den fjernkørende kerne (amule/amuled) ned.\n"
"Dette vil også lukke tekstklienten ned, da den er ubrugelig uden en\n"
"kørende kerne.\n"

