#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Execute a search."
msgstr "Udfør en søgning."

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"A search type has to be specified by giving the type:\n"
"    GLOBAL\n"
"    LOCAL\n"
"    KAD\n"
"Example: 'search kad file' will execute a kad search for \"file\".\n"
"\n"
"Optional filters can be added before, after, or interleaved with\n"
"the search keyword(s):\n"
"    --type <Audio|Video|Image|Doc|Pro|Arc|Iso>\n"
"    --extension <ext>      (alias: --ext)\n"
"    --avail <N>            minimum number of sources\n"
"    --min-size <N[KMG]>    smallest file size; K=1024, M=K*1024, G=M*1024\n"
"    --max-size <N[KMG]>    largest file size; same suffixes\n"
"Example: 'search global linux iso --type Iso --min-size 100M' returns\n"
"results for \"linux iso\" of file-type Iso at least 100 MiB.\n"
msgstr ""
"En søgetype skal angives ved at give typen:\n"
"    GLOBAL\n"
"    LOCAL\n"
"    KAD\n"
"Eksempel: 'search kad file' udfører en kad-søgning efter \"file\".\n"
"\n"
"Valgfrie filtre kan tilføjes før, efter eller blandet med\n"
"søgeordet/-ordene:\n"
"    --type <Audio|Video|Image|Doc|Pro|Arc|Iso>\n"
"    --extension <ext>      (alias: --ext)\n"
"    --avail <N>            minimum antal kilder\n"
"    --min-size <N[KMG]>    mindste filstørrelse; K=1024, M=K*1024, G=M*1024\n"
"    --max-size <N[KMG]>    største filstørrelse; samme endelser\n"
"Eksempel: 'search global linux iso --type Iso --min-size 100M' returnerer\n"
"resultater for \"linux iso\" af filtypen Iso på mindst 100 MiB.\n"

